                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I recommend this game!\n\nThis game is difficult, but challenging in a way that keeps you playing just to see if you can get to the next level. It looks like it's a puzzle game, but that is only a small percent of what makes up this game. It requires equal parts luck and skill. The point of the game is to grow your garden and avoid the monsters. It is a casual game with infinite lives.\n\nPros:\nWorth the money\nChallenging\nSimple controls (just a joystick and one button)\n\nCons:\nSometimes you misdirect your character because you are moving on diagonal planes. I've lost many lives because I accidentally went the wrong direction.",
